1
00:00:00,430 --> 00:00:01,750
(Được chép bởi TurboScribe. Nâng cấp lên Không giới hạn để gỡ bỏ thông báo này.) It is Halloween.

2
00:00:02,970 --> 00:00:06,950
Halloween is the time when people dress up.

3
00:00:08,230 --> 00:00:10,370
Young people like to dress up.

4
00:00:11,010 --> 00:00:14,010
Old people just wear regular clothes.

5
00:00:15,170 --> 00:00:17,350
Children like to go trick-or-treating.

6
00:00:17,950 --> 00:00:19,550
They go to a house.

7
00:00:19,970 --> 00:00:21,490
They ring the doorbell.

8
00:00:21,490 --> 00:00:24,930
They say trick-or-treat.

9
00:00:25,290 --> 00:00:26,970
They get candy.

10
00:00:27,910 --> 00:00:29,930
They go to another house.
